  "description": "SB Admin 2 theme for the WA.Core Blazor UI: the look of the original WA Angular client (SB Admin 2 on Bootstrap 3): fixed top navbar with the workplace and user menus, the profile tree on the left, panel dialogs, compact controls, alertify-style notifications. An Aether-compatible kit and the shared FViewer markup; no Bootstrap, no jQuery, no theme JavaScript at all. Built on SI.WA.UI.Core.",
